FILE: contextpack.rs
MOD: commands/contextcmd
OWNS: context-pack resolution — orchestrates lmindex::build_context_pack() for a given source file
PROFILE: [io]
CHANGE-FREQUENCY: volatile

run: &str * bool → Result<(), String> [io]
  calls: lmindex::build_context_pack, llmcode::discover_llmcode_files
  note: always rebuilds in-memory (no index cache read in v0.6.0 — is_index_fresh() reserved for future fast-path)

DEPENDS-ON: context, lmindex, llmcode

KEY-INVARIANTS:
- owner_module may be None when target file is not declared in architecture YAML — output must degrade gracefully, not error

